        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin PD016-PASS, Boulder Arched Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\nThe Boulder Pocket Door Passage Set has an arched shape that makes it fit beautifully into contemporary home styles. A passage set, the PD016 comes packaged with two pulls, one for each side of the door. It has just a .16 inch projection that makes it great for sliding pocket doors. It is installed by mortising it into the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/boulder-pocket-door-privacy-set-baldwin-pd016-priv\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/boulder-pocket-door-keyed-entry-baldwin-pd016-entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Boulder Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 9.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 6.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Depth: .24\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: 1.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-PD016-specifications.gif?v=1704354624\" width=\"243\" height=\"362\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin PD016 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
